ass="w-10 h-10 rounded-[12px] bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.1] flex items-center justify-center text-lg flex-shrink-0">📞</div><div><div class="text-[13.5px] font-bold text-white mb-0.5">One Lead at a Time</div><div class="text-[12px] font-medium text-white/50 leading-[1.45]">Automated distribution ensures no cherry-picking.</div></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3.5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[12px] bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.1] flex items-center justify-center text-lg flex-shrink-0">⏱️</div><div><div class="text-[13.5px] font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Timestamped Actions</div><div class="text-[12px] font-medium text-white/50 leading-[1.45]">Every call click and status update is logged.</div></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3.5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[12px] bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.1] flex items-center justify-center text-lg flex-shrink-0">📶</div><div><div class="text-[13.5px] font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Offline Resilience</div><div class="text-[12px] font-medium text-white/50 leading-[1.45]">Keep working even when the internet drops.</div></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3.5"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-[12px] bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/[0.1] flex items-center justify-center text-lg flex-shrink-0">📈</div><div><div class="text-[13.5px] font-bold text-white mb-0.5">Admin Analytics</div><div class="text-[12px] font-medium text-white/50 leading-[1.45]">Live view into telecaller performance and queue size.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="text-[11.5px] font-semibold text-white/30 pt-8 border-t border-white/[0.08]">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Buildogram Telecalling</div></div><div class="flex-1 flex items-start lg:items-center justify-center p-6 pt-12 lg:p-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-800 lg:bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="w-full max-w-[420px] bg-white rounded-[20px] p-8 shadow-[0_8px_32px_-8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)]"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-8